{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事314回目にしてたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日が314回目です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼うー／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんにれいかと私"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「うー」ってした口の形似てるって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われるんだあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドレッシングって可愛くない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかわかるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"具のドレッシングとか。かわいい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スパイスもかわいいなって思うー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局数学はできたのかい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはサンタさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何頼む？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタさんかあ///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理が上手になる魔法を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お願いするよ☆←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスソングはなにが一番すき?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのーあれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の人が歌ってるやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私社会苦手ー(・ω-｀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗記できない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら好きになれるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暗記しよう暗記しようって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えない。ノートや教科書"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく読んだら全部話が繋がってるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物語を覚えようとすると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくなるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年を振り返って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字一文字で表すとしたら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(理由はまた今度書くね)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"異性と２人っきりになると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"固まってしまいますか？ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだろう。固まりはしないかなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"掃除得意なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から、整理整頓してる方？( ´艸｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔は大嫌いだったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は大好き！趣味に入るくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から綺麗を心がけてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお洋服とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこで買ってますか？//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で買う時は古着とか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもほとんどママのおさがりだよ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年内最後のライブが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決定しましたーーーーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2012年12月27日（木）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zepp Tokyoで二回公演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ♪ライブ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー楽しみー♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行ける方はぜひ来てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その前にお台場合衆国ライブや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会もあるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/11/5202141/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛りだくさんっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra